<div class="personalization-container " id="web-application-body-container">
	<div>
<div class="targetContent parsys containsResourceName resourceClass-parsys"><div class="ans_landing_bg"></div>
<h1 class="text-center" id="search_without_banner_h1">Find Answers, Learn and Share your Knowledge</h1>
<div class="row add_margin_32" translate="no">
  <div class="col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1 col-lg-8 offset-lg-2">
    <div id="landing_search">
      <div class="-presentation_h1" id="inpage_search_container">
        <form id="answerssearch_form" accept-charset="UTF-8" action="/matlabcentral/answers/?s_tid=ans_lp_search" method="get" role="form">
          <div class="input-group -has_typeahead">
            <label class="visually-hidden" for="lp_answerssearch">Search Answers</label>
            <input type="search" name="term" id="lp_answerssearch" value="" class="form-control" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Search Answers" aria-label="Search Answers" />
            <button id="submitsearch" class="btn icon-search btn_color_blue" value="Search" type="submit">
              <span class="visually-hidden">Search</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


<div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-8">
      <div class="modal fade" id="getting_started_modal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="getting_started_modal_label" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <p class="modal-title" id="getting_started_modal_label">Get Started</p>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <div class="mw_ws_accordion_container">
          <div class="accordion" id="getting_started_accordion">
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <div class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#getting_started_accordion_s" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="getting_started_accordion_s">
                  How to search
                </button>
              </div>
              <div id="getting_started_accordion_s" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#getting_started_accordion" style="">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>Before you ask a question, search to see if the question already exists or has been answered.</p>
                  <ul>
                      <li>You can use filters to refine your search.</li>
                      <li>You can filter by status (answered, answer accepted, or unanswered), category, product, or date asked.</li>
                      <li>You can also use tags or search directives. All questions are tagged with one or more keywords to help community members find questions and answers of interest.</li>
                      <li>When searching for an answer, select the best answer based on usefulness and votes, which help indicate quality.</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <div class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#getting_started_accordion_0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="getting_started_accordion_0">
                  How to ask a good question
                </button>
              </div>
              <div id="getting_started_accordion_0" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#getting_started_accordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <ul>
                      <li>Be descriptive, specific, and concise. Example: How can I use a plot to change the line color of a graph?</li>
                      <li>Focus on a single issue, only.</li>
                      <li>In the title, include error numbers, if applicable.</li>
                      <li>List steps you already tried.</li>
                      <li>Include sufficient code so others can understand the problem.</li>
                      <li>Add one- or two-word tags that describe your question.  Use tags that are brief and easily understood.</li>
                      <li>Indicate which add-on products (toolboxes or blocksets) are relevant, if applicable.</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <div class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#getting_started_accordion_1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="getting_started_accordion_1">
                  How to create a helpful answer
                </button>
              </div>
              <div id="getting_started_accordion_1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#getting_started_accordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>When answering a question:</p>
                  <ul>
                      <li>Read the complete question before you start to write an answer.</li>
                      <li>If you need clarification about a question, add a comment.</li>
                      <li>If you know an answer already exists, add a link to it in your answer.</li>
                      <li>Be kind and considerate. Answers that contain profanity, vulgarity, or use an offensive tone will be removed.</li>
                  </ul>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <div class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#getting_started_accordion_2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="getting_started_accordion_2">
                  How to earn reputation
                </button>
              </div>
              <div id="getting_started_accordion_2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#getting_started_accordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>You earn reputation points when someone:</p>
                  <ul>
                      <li>Accepts one of your answers = 4 points</li>
                      <li>Votes for your answer = 2 points</li>
                      <li>Votes for your question = 1 point</li>
                  <ul>
                  <p></p>
                  <p>The higher your reputation score, the more privileges you earn—from being able to add tags to questions, up to deleting questions, answers, and comments.</p>
                  <p>Check My MATLAB Answers to view your reputation score and the privileges you’ve earned.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <div class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#getting_started_accordion_3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="getting_started_accordion_3">
                  Frequently asked MATLAB questions
                </button>
              </div>
              <div id="getting_started_accordion_3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#getting_started_accordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>The most frequently asked questions about MATLAB and Simulink</p>
                  <p><a href="/matlabcentral/answers/faqs/?s_tid=ans_lp_faq">View MATLAB FAQs</a></p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn_color_blue" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
      </div> 
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

      <div id="getting_started" class="d-none d-md-block add_margin_32 lp_gs_heading">
  <h2>Get Started</h2>
  <p>Not sure how to begin? Review resources, tips and best practices.</p>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col lp_gs_image">
      <img src="/matlabcentral/answers/get_started.svg" alt="Get Started">
    </div>
    <div class="col lp_gs_links">
      <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
        <li class="list-group-item how_to_search">
          <a id="get_started_search_link" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#getting_started_modal" data-tab="#getting_started_accordion_s" href="#" class="getting_started_modal_link icon-search">How to search</a>
        </li>
        <li class="list-group-item how_to_ask">
          <a id="get_started_question_link" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#getting_started_modal" data-tab="#getting_started_accordion_0" href="#" class="getting_started_modal_link icon-questions">How to ask a good question</a>
        </li>
        <li class="list-group-item how_to_answer">
          <a id="get_started_answer_link" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#getting_started_modal" data-tab="#getting_started_accordion_1" href="#" class="getting_started_modal_link icon-answers">How to create a helpful answer</a>
        </li>
        <li class="list-group-item how_to_earn_rep">
          <a id="get_started_reputation_link" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#getting_started_modal" data-tab="#getting_started_accordion_2" href="#" class="getting_started_modal_link icon-rating">How to earn reputation</a>
        </li>
        <li class="list-group-item faqs">
          <a class="icon-watch" href="/matlabcentral/answers/faqs/?s_tid=ans_lp_faq">Frequently asked MATLAB questions</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script type="text/javascript">
  // open the correct tab when clicking on the getting started modal
  document.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
    if (e.target.matches('.getting_started_modal_link')) {
      // collapse all sections in the getting started modal
      document.querySelectorAll('#getting_started_modal .accordion-button').forEach(btn => {
        btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        btn.classList.add('collapsed');
      });
  
      document.querySelectorAll("[id^='getting_started_accordion_']").forEach(bdy => {
        bdy.classList.remove('show');
      });
  
      // expand the indicated getting started modal section
      const tabId = e.target.getAttribute('data-tab');
      const titlePanel = document.querySelectorAll('[data-bs-target="' + tabId + '"]').forEach(bdy => {
        bdy.classList.remove('collapsed');
      });
  
      const tab = document.querySelector(tabId);
      if (tab) {
        tab.classList.add('show');
      }
    }
  });
</script>

